    <!-- SECTION 6: Google reviews slider -->
    <div class="home-reviews-section">
      <div class="home-reviews-slider">
        <button class="home-slider-btn home-slider-arrow" id="home-reviews-prev">
          <span class="glyphicon glyphicon-chevron-left"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="home-reviews-viewport">
          <div class="home-reviews-track">
            <div class="home-review-slide">
              <div class="review-card">
                <div class="review-head">
                  <span class="review-avatar" style="background-color: #db4437;">R</span>
                  <span class="review-author">Roman D.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                <p class="review-text">I recently worked with Vancouver Luxury Rentals while searching for a high-end property in the Vancouver area, and overall, my experience was very positive. From the start, the team was professional, responsive, and well-organized. My agent took the time to understand what I was looking for and provided several suitable options within days. The booking process was smooth, and all paperwork was handled efficiently with clear communication throughout.</p>
                <a class="review-source" href="https://share.google/ezC68yh9W5CEW41Fu" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on Google</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="home-review-slide">
              <div class="review-card">
                <div class="review-head">
                  <span class="review-avatar" style="background-color: #f4b400;">S</span>
                  <span class="review-author">Saaed A.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                <p class="review-text">I've had an excellent experience as a tenant with VLR. The team is friendly, responsive, and genuinely cares about keeping the property well-maintained. Any issues I've raised have been handled quickly and professionally, which makes a big difference as a renter. It's been refreshing to deal with a property management company that's so organized and respectful. Highly recommend them to anyone looking for a smooth and reliable rental experience!</p>
                <a class="review-source" href="https://share.google/mpQ0VYCRi87W9kRZk" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on Google</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="home-review-slide">
              <div class="review-card">
                <div class="review-head">
                  <span class="review-avatar" style="background-color: #0f9d58;">M</span>
                  <span class="review-author">Maddalen P.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                <p class="review-text">Vancouver Luxury Rentals is the by far the best rental company in Vancouver. I have moved 4 times in the last 8 years, and every apartment I have found has been through VLR. They are the most professional when it comes to their standards and the way they conduct business. They have all the best listings and options out of any other company. I have also listed with them and their preparation and standards got my unit rented right away. Every touch point of the business has been intentionally thought out. Not to mention all their staff are extremely knowledgeable and efficient.</p>
                <a class="review-source" href="https://share.google/070YQuxiNrwQKE5UG" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on Google</a>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="home-review-slide">
              <div class="review-card">
                <div class="review-head">
                  <span class="review-avatar" style="background-color: #4285f4;">H</span>
                  <span class="review-author">Harrison N.</span>
                </div>
                <div class="review-stars">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>
                <p class="review-text">I have been working with VLR since my move to Vancouver four years ago. From finding my first apartment to each subsequent place, VLR has consistently delivered in helping me find and secure a home that fit my requirements. Expect unparalleled care, strict attention to detail and a seamless rental experience every time. Can't recommend this team enough.</p>
                <a class="review-source" href="https://share.google/Jp0xtW3T9AVTCiwdz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">View on Google</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
